{"id":"plupart","lemma":"plupart","pos":"noun","rank":791,"glosses":["main part, majority","most of"],"ipa":"/ply.paʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/Fr-plupart.ogg/Fr-plupart.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","examples":[{"text":"Je hais la plupart des gens.","en":"I hate most people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097753","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"haïr"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"people"}]},{"text":"Que fais-tu, la plupart du temps ?","en":"What do you spend most of your time doing?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"La plupart de nos employés sont jeunes.","en":"Most of our employees are young.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},{"g":"employee","l":"employé"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"young","l":"jeune"}]},{"text":"La plupart de mes amis sont des filles.","en":"Most of my friends are girls.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend","l":"ami"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"girl","l":"fille"}]},{"text":"La plupart s'en fiche.","en":"Most of them just don't care.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to plug in","l":"ficher"}]}]}